asis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc","order":5864},{"id":"yaoci-e-o071","title":"刺史丁宫征还京都，壹侍送勤恪，宫感之许他日相辟；后宫为司徒辟壹，比至宫已免","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-1090ffbf93016ae7fd76","label":"正文","text":"刺史丁宫征还京都，壹侍送勤恪，宫感之许他日相辟；后宫为司徒辟壹，比至宫已免","evidence":["yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-112a979702bd5d2ec169","label":"正文","text":"黄琬代丁宫为司徒，甚礼遇士壹；董卓作乱，壹亡归乡里","evidence":["yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2"]},{"id":"yaoci-a-b0a19ce801df75e7002e","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"琬与卓相害，壹尽心于琬甚有声称；卓恶之，署教曰司徒掾士壹不得除用，故历年不迁；会卓入关，壹乃亡归","evidence":["yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongyuan-p0063","role":"征还而感壹者","evidence":["yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0014","role":"侍送受辟者；被礼遇而亡归者；尽心于琬而被抑亡归者","evidence":["yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a","yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0071","role":"礼遇者；相害之一方","evidence":["yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4"]},{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"作乱者（背景）；恶壹而抑之者","evidence":["yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a","yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a","source_order":[49,177,18],"order":8986}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0071","name":"黄琬","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p024","dongyuan-q-p023","gongsuntao-q-d750c8e065670b87c084","yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4","fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc"],"facts":[{"id":"dongyuan-f0064","label":"来源姓名","text":"黄琬","evidence":["dongyuan-f0064-q"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p024-xiahoucao-p0071","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p024"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p023-dongyuan-p0069","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p023"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-m-review-b1518fd6b0e0bae5e410","kind":"mention","text":"黄琬见于相关言论或记载。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-d750c8e065670b87c084"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p023a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-910a7d4ce284373de1eb","layer":"pei","quote":"太尉黄琬、司徒杨彪、司空荀爽，俱诣卓。卓言：‘昔高祖都关中。十一世后中兴，更都洛阳。从光武至今复十一世，案《石苞室谶》，宜复还都长安。’坐中皆惊愕，无敢应者。彪曰：‘迁都改制，天下大事。皆当因民之心，随时之宜。昔盘庚五迁，殷民胥怨；故作三篇以晓之。往者王莽篡逆，变乱五常；更始赤眉之时，焚烧长安，残害百姓；民人流亡，百无一在。光武受命，更都洛邑，此其宜也。今方建立圣主，光隆汉祚；而无故捐宫庙，弃园陵；恐百姓惊愕，不解此意，必麋沸蚁聚，以致扰乱。《石苞室谶》，妖邪之书，岂可信用！’卓作色曰：‘杨公欲沮国家计邪！关东方乱，所在贼起。崤函险固，国之重防；又陇右取材，功夫不难。杜陵南山下，有孝武故陶处，作砖瓦，一朝可办。宫室官府，盖何足言！百姓小民，何足与议！若有前却，我以大兵驱之，岂得自在！’百僚皆恐怖失色。琬谓卓曰：‘此大事。杨公之语，得无重思？’卓罢坐，即日令司隶奏彪及琬，皆免官。","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fac3d6f4ee3a1da797ef","start":8,"end":402,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-f0064-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-910a7d4ce284373de1eb","layer":"pei","quote":"太尉黄琬","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fac3d6f4ee3a1da797ef","start":8,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p023","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-910a7d4ce284373de1eb","layer":"pei","quote":"《续汉书》曰：“太尉黄琬、司徒杨彪、司空荀爽，俱诣卓。卓言：‘昔高祖都关中。十一世后中兴，更都洛阳。从光武至今复十一世，案《石苞室谶》，宜复还都长安。’坐中皆惊愕，无敢应者。彪曰：‘迁都改制，天下大事。皆当因民之心，随时之宜。昔盘庚五迁，殷民胥怨；故作三篇以晓之。往者王莽篡逆，变乱五常；更始赤眉之时，焚烧长安，残害百姓；民人流亡，百无一在。光武受命，更都洛邑，此其宜也。今方建立圣主，光隆汉祚；而无故捐宫庙，弃园陵；恐百姓惊愕，不解此意，必麋沸蚁聚，以致扰乱。《石苞室谶》，妖邪之书，岂可信用！’卓作色曰：‘杨公欲沮国家计邪！关东方乱，所在贼起。崤函险固，国之重防；又陇右取材，功夫不难。杜陵南山下，有孝武故陶处，作砖瓦，一朝可办。宫室官府，盖何足言！百姓小民，何足与议！若有前却，我以大兵驱之，岂得自在！’百僚皆恐怖失色。琬谓卓曰：‘此大事。杨公之语，得无重思？’卓罢坐，即日令司隶奏彪及琬，皆免官。大驾即西，卓部兵烧洛阳城外面百里。又自将兵烧南北宫及宗庙、府库、民家，城内扫地殄尽。又收诸富室，以罪恶没入其财物；无辜而死者，不可胜计。”","attribution":"《续汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fac3d6f4ee3a1da797ef","start":0,"end":471,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-b721e75a2c4e04e58bbc","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-ce3329711a4ddcc33a21","layer":"original","quote":"沛相陈珪举孝廉〖3〗，太尉黄琬辟〖4〗；皆不就","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-d750c8e065670b87c084","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e3a71fb974e43417ddcc","layer":"pei","quote":"虞让太尉，因荐卫尉赵谟、益州牧刘焉、豫州牧黄琬、南阳太守羊续，并任为公","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6d80a34d17b52f891489","start":11,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p024b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e2c5306130310cdef7e9","layer":"pei","quote":"邵以忠笃有才智，为太祖所亲信。初平中，太祖兴义兵。邵募徒众，从太祖周旋。时豫州刺史黄琬，欲害太祖；太祖避之而邵独遇害。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-92e7d883bbb3d12fd778","start":108,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p024","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e2c5306130310cdef7e9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“真本姓秦，养曹氏。或云其父伯南，夙与太祖善。兴平末，袁术部党与太祖攻劫，太祖出。为寇所追，走入秦氏，伯南开门受之。寇问太祖所在，答云：‘我是也。’遂害之。由此太祖思其功，故变其姓。”《魏书》曰：“邵以忠笃有才智，为太祖所亲信。初平中，太祖兴义兵。邵募徒众，从太祖周旋。时豫州刺史黄琬，欲害太祖；太祖避之而邵独遇害。”","attribution":"《魏略》；《魏书》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-92e7d883bbb3d12fd778","start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-ec8045d3ff0b67bf5120","layer":"pei","quote":"琬与卓相害，而壹尽心于琬，甚有声称。卓恶之，乃署教曰：‘司徒掾士壹，不得除用！’故历年不迁。会卓入关，壹乃亡归","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48f0b2f21db95c73dcf1","start":10,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-4c3e132b7835e845694f","layer":"original","quote":"刺史丁宫征还京都，壹侍送勤恪〖9〗。宫感之，临别谓曰：“刺史若待罪三事〖10〗，当相辟也。”后宫为司徒，辟壹。比至，宫已免","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-4c3e132b7835e845694f","layer":"original","quote":"黄琬代为司徒〖11〗，甚礼遇壹。董卓作乱，壹亡归乡里","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":80,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
